  "title": "ECARX Holdings to Report First Quarter 2026 Financial Results on May 19, 2026",
  "summary": "LONDON, May 7, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- ECARX Holdings Inc. (Nasdaq: ECX) (\"ECARX\" or the \"Company\"), a global mobility tech provider, today announced that it will report its financial results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026, before the U.S. market opens on Tuesday, May 19, 2026.",
